# V-017: the most valuable check in the system.
#
# Two codes, by design. A live child pinning a superseded plan revision is legal only
# when the superseding record disposes of it (docs/04 §5.1) — that exemption is exactly
# what gives V-017 something to bite on. Remove the disposition and both the missing
# disposition and the now-unexcused part_of reference are true at once, so the pair
# cannot be separated. See fixtures/README.md §3.
AKR-R014 12
AKR-L021 28
